      "sourceTerm": "佛",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "relPath": "X/X79/X79n1557.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "世尊一日陞座，大眾集定，迦葉白槌云：世尊說法竟。世尊便下座。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_57145bc70a8d",
      "sourceTerm": "佛",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "X/X79/X79n1557.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "世尊在靈山會上，拈花示眾，眾皆默然，唯迦葉破顏微笑。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_57145bc70a8d",
      "sourceTerm": "佛",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 9,
      "relPath": "X/X80/X80n1565.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "上堂。世尊拈華。迦葉微笑時。人祇知拈華微笑。要且不識世尊。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_57145bc70a8d",
      "sourceTerm": "佛",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 10,
      "relPath": "B/B27/B27n0152.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "至於拈華微笑謂之單傳正法眼藏也引他明眼人至今好笑"
    },
    {
