      "sourceTerm": "庭前柏樹子",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "J/J24/J24nB137.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "問：「柏樹子還有佛性也無？」師云：「有。」云：「幾時成佛？」師云：「待虛空落地。」云：「虛空幾時落地？」師云：「待柏樹子成佛。」"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_7180f7431520",
      "sourceTerm": "恁麼",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 3,
      "relPath": "T/T51/T51n2076.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "賓云總不與麼。師便打。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_1d3706324b0c",
      "sourceTerm": "打成一片",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 4,
      "relPath": "B/B27/B27n0152.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "行住坐臥動靜閒忙打作一片"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_986000f3d4d3",
      "sourceTerm": "拈華微笑",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "relPath": "J/J28/J28nB211.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "世尊在靈山會上拈華顧眾，百萬人天皆悉罔措，唯迦葉尊者破顏微笑。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_986000f3d4d3",
      "sourceTerm": "拈華微笑",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "J/J28/J28nB211.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "世尊云：『吾以正法眼藏、涅槃玅心、實相無相微玅法門，不立文字，教外別傳，付囑摩訶迦葉。』"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_986000f3d4d3",
      "sourceTerm": "拈華微笑",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 2,
      "relPath": "X/X79/X79n1559.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "世尊拈華，迦葉微笑。正當恁麼時，好與三十棒。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_d7a73033c034",
      "sourceTerm": "擔板漢",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "T/T48/T48n2004.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "諸方道。徐六擔板只見一邊。尚書不學牆面。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_4aa29a0183ae",
      "sourceTerm": "斬猫",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "relPath": "T/T48/T48n2004.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "南泉一日。東西兩堂爭猫兒南泉見遂提起云。道得即不斬眾無對泉斬却猫兒為兩段泉復舉前話問趙州州便脫草鞋。於頭上戴出泉云。子若在。恰救得猫兒。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_62044e7bbb87",
      "sourceTerm": "本分事",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "relPath": "B/B14/B14n0082.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "師曰不從千聖借豈向萬機求"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_afefc1399aed",
      "sourceTerm": "本無一物",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 4,
      "relPath": "X/X80/X80n1565.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "菩提本無樹。明鏡亦非臺。本來無一物。何處惹塵埃。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_36aa29eb1287",
      "sourceTerm": "水牯牛",
      "senseIndex": 1,
      "occurrenceIndex": 3,
      "relPath": "C/C077/C077n1710.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "只如南泉尋常道湏向異類中行且作麼生會"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_d35dc9e3723e",
      "sourceTerm": "無念",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "T/T48/T48n2008.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "若百物不思，當令念絕，即是法縛，即名邊見。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_f41961e0e5be",
      "sourceTerm": "牧牛",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 4,
      "relPath": "X/X82/X82n1571.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "兩角指天，四足踏地。拽斷鼻繩，牧甚屎屁。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_4aa0ae72820e",
      "sourceTerm": "現成",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 2,
      "relPath": "T/T47/T47n1997.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "正緣五祖老師有箇見成公案。對眾舉揚。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_b4a4ae6874d0",
      "sourceTerm": "異類中行",
      "senseIndex": 1,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "X/X80/X80n1565.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "泉見乃問。智頭陀前日道。智不到處切忌道著。道著即頭角生。合作麼生行履。師便抽身入僧堂。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_200fc439a99e",
      "sourceTerm": "磨磚作鏡",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "relPath": "X/X78/X78n1556.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "師曰：磨甎作什麼？讓曰：磨甎作鏡。師曰：磨甎豈得成鏡？讓曰：磨甎既不成鏡，汝坐禪豈得成佛？"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_200fc439a99e",
      "sourceTerm": "磨磚作鏡",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "T/T47/T47n1993.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "入海算沙。空自費力。磨塼作鏡。枉用功夫。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_200fc439a99e",
      "sourceTerm": "磨磚作鏡",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 3,
      "relPath": "X/X67/X67n1299.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "坐禪成佛心中病，作鏡磨甎眼裏花"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_539b931c442a",
      "sourceTerm": "秉拂",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "X/X63/X63n1250.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "一一請已，首座同受請。次頭首令行者將牌拂、主杖，即詣方丈稟辭。住持勸請了，送出。首座轉身，借法座、法鼓。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_351fa42d396b",
      "sourceTerm": "粥飯",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 2,
      "relPath": "J/J28/J28nB202.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "參禪學道是汝本分事、喫粥喫飯是汝本分事、屙屎撒尿是汝本分事、行坐打眠是汝本分事"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_c891f0944482",
      "sourceTerm": "腳跟",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 4,
      "relPath": "X/X82/X82n1571.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "因甚在汝脚跟下？師曰：當面蹉過。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_6da91f8ce284",
      "sourceTerm": "賓主",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 2,
      "relPath": "B/B25/B25n0144.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "洞山便問：「如何是賓中主？」云：「白雲蓋青山。」「如何是主中主？」云：「長年不出戶。」"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_6da91f8ce284",
      "sourceTerm": "賓主",
      "senseIndex": 1,
      "occurrenceIndex": 2,
      "relPath": "J/J26/J26nB183.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "前人不肯放，此是膏肓之病，不堪醫治，喚作賓看主。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_6ec308f7766e",
      "sourceTerm": "迷頭認影",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "relPath": "X/X80/X80n1565.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "譬如演若達多認影迷頭。豈不擔頭覓頭。然正迷之時。頭且不失。及乎悟去。亦不為得。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_972b8e6cebdd",
      "sourceTerm": "阿難",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 2,
      "relPath": "X/X79/X79n1559.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "迦葉曰：倒却門前剎竿著。師曰：剎竿未倒，穿却諸人髑髏，換却諸人眼睛。剎竿倒後，向甚麼處見釋迦老子？參！"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_ebb0995c99fc",
      "sourceTerm": "頓悟",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "T/T51/T51n2076.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "有頓漸之異。故曰南頓北漸。非禪宗本有南北之號也。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_327d40c2c9cb",
