      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 3,
      "relPath": "X/X80/X80n1565.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "橫拄杖曰。先照後用。竪起曰。先用後照。倒轉曰。照用同時。卓一下曰。照用不同時。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_4e10d7c80fbc",
      "sourceTerm": "四照用",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 5,
      "relPath": "T/T48/T48n2006.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "照用問答問如何是先照後用。首山云。南嶽嶺頭雲。太行山下賊。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_4f088a7a7f47",
      "sourceTerm": "南泉斬猫",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "relPath": "T/T48/T48n2004.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "南泉一日。東西兩堂爭猫兒南泉見遂提起云。道得即不斬眾無對泉斬却猫兒為兩段泉復舉前話問趙州州便脫草鞋。於頭上戴出泉云。子若在。恰救得猫兒。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_52391cba2cdf",
      "sourceTerm": "三玄三要",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "relPath": "T/T47/T47n1985.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "一句語須具三玄門，一玄門須具三要，有權、有用。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_52391cba2cdf",
      "sourceTerm": "三玄三要",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "T/T47/T47n1985.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "如何是第一句？」師云：「三要印開朱點側，未容擬議主賓分。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_52391cba2cdf",
      "sourceTerm": "三玄三要",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 4,
      "relPath": "T/T48/T48n2006.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "三玄者。玄中玄。體中玄。句中玄。三要者。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_539b931c442a",
      "sourceTerm": "秉拂",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "X/X63/X63n1250.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "一一請已，首座同受請。次頭首令行者將牌拂、主杖，即詣方丈稟辭。住持勸請了，送出。首座轉身，借法座、法鼓。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_57145bc70a8d",
      "sourceTerm": "佛",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "relPath": "X/X79/X79n1557.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "世尊一日陞座，大眾集定，迦葉白槌云：世尊說法竟。世尊便下座。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_57145bc70a8d",
      "sourceTerm": "佛",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "X/X79/X79n1557.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "世尊在靈山會上，拈花示眾，眾皆默然，唯迦葉破顏微笑。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_57145bc70a8d",
      "sourceTerm": "佛",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 9,
      "relPath": "X/X80/X80n1565.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "上堂。世尊拈華。迦葉微笑時。人祇知拈華微笑。要且不識世尊。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_57145bc70a8d",
      "sourceTerm": "佛",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 10,
      "relPath": "B/B27/B27n0152.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "至於拈華微笑謂之單傳正法眼藏也引他明眼人至今好笑"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_61c90d3a8edd",
      "sourceTerm": "兼中到",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 5,
      "relPath": "X/X72/X72n1437.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "寂音改兼中至為偏中至，以對正中來，大悞後學，今"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_62044e7bbb87",
      "sourceTerm": "本分事",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "relPath": "B/B14/B14n0082.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "師曰不從千聖借豈向萬機求"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_6da91f8ce284",
      "sourceTerm": "賓主",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 2,
      "relPath": "B/B25/B25n0144.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "洞山便問：「如何是賓中主？」云：「白雲蓋青山。」「如何是主中主？」云：「長年不出戶。」"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_6da91f8ce284",
      "sourceTerm": "賓主",
      "senseIndex": 1,
      "occurrenceIndex": 2,
      "relPath": "J/J26/J26nB183.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "前人不肯放，此是膏肓之病，不堪醫治，喚作賓看主。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_6ec308f7766e",
      "sourceTerm": "迷頭認影",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "relPath": "X/X80/X80n1565.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "譬如演若達多認影迷頭。豈不擔頭覓頭。然正迷之時。頭且不失。及乎悟去。亦不為得。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_7180f7431520",
      "sourceTerm": "恁麼",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 3,
      "relPath": "T/T51/T51n2076.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "賓云總不與麼。師便打。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_7d440e0d91b4",
      "sourceTerm": "公案",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 2,
      "relPath": "T/T48/T48n2003.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "二字乃世間法中吏牘語"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_81147ad4e8bf",
      "sourceTerm": "四料揀",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "relPath": "T/T47/T47n1985.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "有時人境俱奪、有時人境俱不奪。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_81147ad4e8bf",
      "sourceTerm": "四料揀",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 4,
      "relPath": "X/X80/X80n1565.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "至晚小參。曰。有時奪人不奪境。有時奪境不奪人。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_81147ad4e8bf",
      "sourceTerm": "四料揀",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 5,
      "relPath": "X/X80/X80n1565.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "如何是奪人不奪境。師曰。惺惺寂寂。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_830700de49fb",
      "sourceTerm": "三句",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "relPath": "T/T48/T48n2006.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "汾陽上堂僧出問。如何是學人著力句。汾云。嘉州打大像。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_830700de49fb",
      "sourceTerm": "三句",
      "senseIndex": 1,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "T/T47/T47n1988.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "示眾云天中函蓋乾坤目機銖兩。不涉春緣。作麼生承當。代云。一鏃破三關。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_830700de49fb",
      "sourceTerm": "三句",
      "senseIndex": 1,
      "occurrenceIndex": 2,
      "relPath": "X/X80/X80n1565.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "僧問。如何是函蓋乾坤句。師曰。天上有星皆拱北。曰。如何是截斷眾流句。師曰。大地坦"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_830700de49fb",
      "sourceTerm": "三句",
      "senseIndex": 2,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "T/T47/T47n1985.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "僧問：「如何是第一句？」師云：「三要印開朱點側，未容擬議主賓分。」"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_8650004bb9d7",
      "sourceTerm": "兼中至",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "T/T47/T47n1987B.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "偏中至者中孚也。隨物不礙"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_8650004bb9d7",
      "sourceTerm": "兼中至",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 3,
      "relPath": "T/T47/T47n1987A.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "裏頭才轉身。塵中未帶名。是曰偏中至。不是心。不是境"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_8bd6933e6de3",
      "sourceTerm": "一喝",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 2,
      "relPath": "C/C077/C077n1710.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "問德山棒臨濟喝意旨如何師云寶應今日不用"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_972b8e6cebdd",
      "sourceTerm": "阿難",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 2,
      "relPath": "X/X79/X79n1559.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "迦葉曰：倒却門前剎竿著。師曰：剎竿未倒，穿却諸人髑髏，換却諸人眼睛。剎竿倒後，向甚麼處見釋迦老子？參！"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_986000f3d4d3",
      "sourceTerm": "拈華微笑",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "relPath": "J/J28/J28nB211.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "世尊在靈山會上拈華顧眾，百萬人天皆悉罔措，唯迦葉尊者破顏微笑。"
    },
    {
