      "sourceTerm": "拈華微笑",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "J/J28/J28nB211.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "世尊云：『吾以正法眼藏、涅槃玅心、實相無相微玅法門，不立文字，教外別傳，付囑摩訶迦葉。』"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_986000f3d4d3",
