      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 2,
      "relPath": "X/X79/X79n1559.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "世尊拈華，迦葉微笑。正當恁麼時，好與三十棒。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_a234d7149c81",
