      "sourceTerm": "受戒",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 4,
      "relPath": "T/T48/T48n2007.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "善知識！總須自體與受無相戒。一時，逐惠能口道，令善知識見自三身佛"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_aab4ca02ec21",
      "sourceTerm": "呵呵大笑",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "relPath": "X/X79/X79n1557.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "適來哭，如今為甚却笑？師云：適來哭，如今笑"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
