      "relPath": "T/T47/T47n1998A.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "師云。諸方拈掇甚多。下注脚亦不少。未曾有一人分明說破。妙喜今日為諸人分明說破。喫粥了便洗鉢盂。且道。還曾指示無。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_e34e9defcb79",
      "sourceTerm": "喫粥了也未",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 5,
      "relPath": "X/X82/X82n1571.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "上堂：喫粥了也，頭上安頭。洗鉢盂去，為虵畫足。更問如何日納敗闕？"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_ebb0995c99fc",
      "sourceTerm": "頓悟",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "T/T51/T51n2076.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "有頓漸之異。故曰南頓北漸。非禪宗本有南北之號也。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_ed962dfd1158",
      "sourceTerm": "四賓主",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 0,
      "relPath": "T/T47/T47n1985.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "此是膏肓之病不堪醫，喚作客看主。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_ed962dfd1158",
      "sourceTerm": "四賓主",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 2,
      "relPath": "T/T48/T48n2006.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "學人無鼻孔。名賓中賓。與曹洞賓主不同。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_ed962dfd1158",
      "sourceTerm": "四賓主",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 4,
      "relPath": "X/X73/X73n1457.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "主看賓，有時賓看主，有時主看主，有時賓看賓"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_f41961e0e5be",
      "sourceTerm": "牧牛",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 4,
      "relPath": "X/X82/X82n1571.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "兩角指天，四足踏地。拽斷鼻繩，牧甚屎屁。"
    },
    {
      "origin": "term-file",
      "entryId": "t_f6c2a28b1c6e",
      "sourceTerm": "參同契",
      "senseIndex": 0,
      "occurrenceIndex": 4,
      "relPath": "X/X72/X72n1442.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "承言須會宗，勿自立規矩。觸目不會道，運足焉知路。進步非近遠，迷隔山河固。謹白參玄人，光陰莫虗度。"
    }
  ]
